    "title": "API-DocTest-Replace Fitness Memberships Freeze-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Manage Fitness Membership Freezes API enables fitness centers to efficiently handle membership freeze requests from their clients. With this endpoint, authorized personnel can update the status of a member's account to reflect a temporary freeze, allowing members to pause their memberships for a specified duration. This functionality is particularly useful for customer service teams and membership management software, ensuring a seamless experience for customers seeking to manage their fitness plans during temporary absences. The endpoint supports changes to the membership freeze status while maintaining accurate accounts.",
